+# Local VDA transport-recovery patch
+
+This checkout contains a deliberately isolated local compatibility patch for
+Virtuoso Design Agent (VDA). Do not push this branch to the third-party
+`Arcadia-1/virtuoso-bridge-lite` origin.
+
+Current integration: `codex/vda-upstream-main-20261018`, upstream main pinned to
+`ecaf5a5c5499051ea4c4796a480e278a3e9c0da8` (1.0.0 plus post-release fixes).
+The dated entries below remain historical; the final 2026-10-18 section describes
+which old implementations were retained or superseded.
+
